/* SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
 *
 * AmiCachy stylesheet (F3, minimal). Real theming is F5.
 *
 * Intentionally does NOT restyle the main content area: an earlier dark
 * #mainApp background made Calamares' default dark text (e.g. the locale
 * summary on the Location page) unreadable. The AmiCachy identity comes from
 * the sidebar (styled via branding.desc: SidebarBackground/Text/...), so the
 * content area keeps Calamares' readable light default until F5.
 */
